  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "黑胶放映室 · 专业影音套件": "Vinyl & Cinema Studio · Pro Media Suite",
      "面向电影拉片、视频审片、无损黑胶听音与播客精听的一站式专业影音套件。深度接入宿主标准媒体能力总线，支持 MKV 内封多语字幕直切、FFmpeg 长音频流式真波形，并对放映室、黑胶台与唱片墙进行了全面视觉美学精修，默认搭配银盐暗房主题。": "An all-in-one studio suite for film study, video review, lossless Hi-Fi vinyl listening, and podcast study — wired into the host media capability bus for instant MKV embedded multilingual subtitles, streaming FFmpeg audio waveforms, and refined darkroom aesthetics across Cine Room, Vinyl Deck, and Media Wall.",
      "黑胶放映室 · 综合影音": "Screening Room · All Media",
      "混排自适应唱片与放映墙并配黑胶放映厅主页；视频悬停逐帧预览、黑胶唱片出鞘动效，左侧导航与智能工具容器自动切换台词分镜与黑胶控台，右侧查看详情。": "Adaptive vinyl sleeves & widescreen cinema wall paired with the Media Hub, live hover scrubbing, smart contextual panels on the left, and inspector on the right.",
      "黑胶唱片馆 · 音乐专注": "Vinyl Hall · Hi-Fi Music",
      "以 1:1 黑胶方砖按专辑陈列曲库，搭配黑胶台 Hi-Fi 唱盘、实时频谱、双语歌词、10 段参数 EQ 与歌单队列智能控台。": "Browse your music library as album-grouped 1:1 vinyl sleeves with turntable visuals, live spectrum, bilingual lyrics, 10-band EQ, and smart queue dock.",
      "拉片与剪辑台 · 视频精研": "Screening Desk · Film Study",
      "以 16:9 影院宽幕按观看状态组织片库；逐帧步进、A-B 循环、双语字幕稿、分镜标记导出 EDL/FCPXML 与双视频同步对比一应俱全。": "Organize videos as 16:9 film frames grouped by watch state with frame stepping, A-B loop, bilingual transcripts, EDL/FCPXML exports, and dual A/B comparison.",
      "preview": "Previews",
      "video": "Video",
      "audio": "Audio",
