      "听译剪辑工坊 · 离线语音转写与视频拆解套件": "Audio-Video AI Studio · Offline Whisper Transcription & Video Breakdown Suite",
      "面向播客整理、访谈听译、电影拉片与视频二创的全栈离线音视频 AI 工坊套件：集成 Whisper 离线语音引擎（配合官方 Apple Silicon Metal 共享运行包 huoye-whisper，零 Python 依赖）、听译字幕工坊（按需转写绝不自动占 GPU、全文自动进入活页全局 FTS 检索、逐句时间戳点击跳转、SRT/VTT 导出与一键沉淀 Markdown 笔记）以及视频分镜与无损快剪工坊（毫秒级 -c copy 无损秒切、FFmpeg 自动场景分镜拆解与暗房/银盐高清故事板），并联袂黑胶放映室三大影音插件与 8 个生态整理插件。": "Full-stack offline audio & video AI suite for podcasts, interviews, film study, and video remixing: combines Whisper Offline Speech Engine (powered by the official Apple Silicon Metal huoye-whisper shared runtime with zero Python dependencies), Whisper Subtitle Studio (strictly on-demand transcription, global FTS search, click-to-seek cues, SRT/VTT export, and one-click Markdown notes), and Clip Cutter (lossless -c copy trimming, FFmpeg automatic scene breakdown, and Darkroom/Silver HD storyboards), together with Cine Room, Vinyl Deck, Media Shelf, and 8 core curation plugins.",
      "听译字幕与全文检索": "Whisper Subtitles & Full-Text Search",
      "面向播客听记、访谈整理与课程字幕检索的离线听译工作台：按需启动 Apple Silicon Metal 加速的本地 Whisper 离线语音引擎（导入音视频零 GPU 消耗），转写全文自动接入活页全局 FTS 检索，支持双主标签在全库影音墙与「已听写字幕」专库间切换，并一键导出 SRT/VTT 或沉淀为库内 Markdown 笔记。": "Offline transcription workspace for podcasts, interviews, and lectures: launches Apple Silicon Metal Whisper strictly on demand (zero GPU usage on import), indexes full transcripts into Huoye global FTS search, pairs the full Media Wall with a Transcribed Subtitles tab, and exports SRT/VTT or library Markdown notes in one click.",
      "视频分镜与无损快剪": "Clip Cutter",
      "面向剪辑师、拉片导演与视频创作者的拆解剪辑工作台：主视图以 16:9 影院宽幕组织视频片库并辅以「已听写字幕」与「黑胶放映厅」标签，随时呼出「视频分镜与无损快剪工坊」完成毫秒级 -c copy 无损秒切、FFmpeg 自动镜头分镜拆解与暗房/银盐高清故事板合成。": "Breakdown and editing workspace for video creators and film editors: organizes clips in a 16:9 cinema wall alongside Transcribed Subtitles and Media Hub tabs, with instant access to Clip Cutter for lossless -c copy trimming, FFmpeg auto scene splitting, and Darkroom/Silver HD storyboards.",
      "text": "Text",
      "文字": "Text",
      "Whisper 离线语音引擎": "Whisper Speech Engine",
      "听译字幕工坊": "Whisper Subtitle Studio",
      "视频分镜与无损快剪工坊 · Clip Cutter": "Clip Cutter · Video Storyboard & Lossless Trimmer",
      "黑胶放映与听译": "Screening & Transcript Studio",
      "将放映室、黑胶台、离线语音听译与视频无损快剪合为一套：逐帧拉片、黑胶听音、搜台词直达原声与自动分镜剪辑按预设切换。": "Combines Cine Room, Vinyl Deck, offline Whisper transcription, and lossless clip cutting — switch presets between film study, Hi-Fi listening, subtitle search, and storyboard trimming.",
      "自适应唱片与影院墙，支持悬停预览、内封多语字幕与真实音频波形。": "Adaptive vinyl and cinema wall with hover scrubbing, embedded multilingual subtitles, and real audio waveforms.",
      "按专辑陈列 1:1 唱片封套，配黑胶唱盘、滚动歌词与 10 段均衡器。": "Album-grouped vinyl wall with turntable deck, synced lyrics, and 10-band EQ.",
      "离线听译与台词检索": "Offline Transcription & Search",
      "按需用本地 Whisper 生成时间码字幕并接入全局搜索，支持导出 SRT/VTT 与笔记。": "Transcribe audio and video locally on demand with searchable cues and SRT/VTT/Markdown export.",
      "拉片分镜与无损快剪": "Storyboards & Lossless Trim",
      "16:9 影院墙配无损秒切、自动镜头分镜拆解与高清故事板，支持不入库直出。": "Widescreen film wall with lossless trimming, automatic scene detection, and HD storyboards.",
